      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "KKR FS Income Trust filed an SC TO-I/A reporting results of its Q3 2026 quarterly repurchase offer, which expired September 29, 2026. The fund offered up to 5.0% of shares outstanding as of June 30, 2026 and received tenders totalling approximately 1.53% of shares outstanding, and will repurchase 100% of shares properly tendered and not withdrawn. Gross subscriptions in the first three quarters of 2026 reached approximately $213 million, 1.7x total repurchases over the same period.",
        "zh": "KKR FS Income Trust提交SC TO-I/A，披露其2026年第三季度季度回购要约的结果，该要约于2026年9月29日到期。该基金提出回购最多相当于2026年6月30日已发行股份5.0%的股份，收到的有效投标约占已发行股份的1.53%，并将回购100%有效投标且未撤回的股份。2026年前三个季度的总认购额约为2.13亿美元，为同期回购总额的1.7倍。"
